  There's no comparison between a late game Caveman and a late
game Wizard, unless you are purposefully playing a Wizard as
a wimpy combat wombat.



  And spell skills make a bigger difference in the endgame, when 
there's more mana and skill slots available.


  If you cast spells, there's a bigger difference between classes 
late in the game than there is early in the game.


  If you don't cast spells, you are voluntarily limiting all your
characters to play the same.





